Z||000000||Got2manyfieros||11-15-2000||10:53 AM||||I'm building a 2.9, which thus far is totall set up for bulletproof operation, and I have spared no expense (except I did not opt for GM's aluminum block as it lists for 6000).<P>Anyway, I was thinking about getting a Design One stage two turbo kit.  It looks like the install isn't too bad, and the advertised performance is excellent.<P>I wanted to know if anyone has had any experience with the kit?<BR>Also, how is Design One to deal with buisness wise?<BR>Also, does the kit include a larger fuel pump/injectors/adjustable fuel pressure regulator?<P>Any info would be much appreciated.<BR>thanks<BR>-Todd||||reg||1
