Z||000004||Black88GT||11-15-2000||03:11 PM||||I think Shaun Hammit was selling an aluminum block, but it was not 6 grand.  Waaay cheaper.  You can use the search function to find him, I think it is still availible but I am not sure.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Shaun41178||11-15-2000||04:25 PM||||WOW!!!  GM is asking $6000 for that aluminum block now?  For one I didn't think it was available anymore meaning I thought they stopped making them, and two the price on them has skyrocketed for them.  I know that the block used to retail for $4000 but it is up to $6000 now?  All I can say is WOW!!  <P>Yea I have one that is for sale.  I was asking $3000 for mine and I had people saying that was asking too much money for it.  Hehehe I guess not.  SALE!! ALuminum block 50% off retail price.  Hmm sounds like an Elder Bearman sale.<P>Oh yea my block is still brand new and in the crate as well.  I have had it out of the crate but only to look at it.  Pics can be provided upon request.<P>I have heard nothing but excellent feedback from owners of the Design One kit.  Everyone says that it is a good kit and with a stock 2.8 provides excellent performance.  The company is very good from what I hear and that Kevin Leslie the owner likes to help as much as he can with questions.  The kit does not include larger fuel injectors or fuel pump.  What he lists on his webpage is what you get.  I am sure he can provide those parts for you though.  I believe he also has a fuel enrichment computer or something out as well.  I would ask him about that.<P>------------------<BR>Shaun-Toledo OH, 85 GT<BR>3.2 With nitrous<BR>http://members.aol.com/shaun41178||||reg||1
